judge_panel.matching_evidence:
The paper should include stronger and more varied baselines, such as:

- GPTQ;
- AWQ;
- SpQR/QuIP-like methods if relevant;
- existing ternary PTQ schemes, especially PTQTP;
- BitNet-style ternary models where applicable;
- low-rank quantization or additive residual quantization baselines.

The paper explicitly says it does not compare head-to-head against established ternary schemes. That is a serious omission because the central claim is about ternary quantization.
